t limit, so v9.0.858-prerelease offered UDP to clients at protocols 8 to 10, whose datagrams it can't read. UdpDatagram.MinLegacyProtocolVersion gates the hello's port and the session's channel, and goes with the legacy UDP","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"bex-co/beancount-io","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:25:51Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"1fe1d03e63d4b3aaa0e599c47e09959a58f19323","github_link":"https://github.com/bex-co/beancount-io/commit/1fe1d03e63d4b3aaa0e599c47e09959a58f19323","commit_subject":"chore(pm): file w21/350-353 (mobile offline cache, unconfirmed writes, logout, load more)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ClickHouse/ClickHouse","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:25:33Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"664a047da07a66fa4f90f3ca3a93e94dc4f6046b","github_link":"https://github.com/ClickHouse/ClickHouse/commit/664a047da07a66fa4f90f3ca3a93e94dc4f6046b","commit_subject":"Use `index_analysis_was_already_done_on_initiator` instead of `index_analysis_skipped`","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ConduitIO/conduit","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:25:23Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"96573054fcbb3bf4d1f308129e1fdd2a95c2606d","github_link":"https://github.com/ConduitIO/conduit/commit/96573054fcbb3bf4d1f308129e1fdd2a95c2606d","commit_subject":"test: run the settings hardening e2e one pipeline per runtime","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"medplum/medplum","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:25:09Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"8329ab35409c4809a6e99fbe9b12e2e0aad3f1a1","github_link":"https://github.com/medplum/medplum/commit/8329ab35409c4809a6e99fbe9b12e2e0aad3f1a1","commit_subject":"[SchedulingWorkspace] Rename `location` -> `service facility` (#11015)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"bex-co/beancount-io","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:25:02Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"7280ccceb9ca386c6094842f9025ae4253946021","github_link":"https://github.com/bex-co/beancount-io/commit/7280ccceb9ca386c6094842f9025ae4253946021","commit_subject":"chore(pm): produc